From 2f0750c5889f0b3121980893943ee42f01e62f4b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: woksin <sindrewilting@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 13:08:11 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/8] Route MongoDB sink writes through a fence seam behind
 Features.ProjectionGenerations

With the flag off the sink makes exactly the driver calls it made before. With
it on every sink write, and each changeset's direct writes as one group, runs in
a fenced batch.
---
 Source/Kernel/Core/Configuration/Features.cs  |  8 +++
 .../Sinks/ChangesetConverter.cs               | 31 +++++++--
 Source/Kernel/Storage.MongoDB/Sinks/Sink.cs   | 68 ++++++++++++++++---
 .../Storage.MongoDB/Sinks/SinkFactory.cs      | 25 ++++++-
 4 files changed, 115 insertions(+), 17 deletions(-)

